## 1. `/users` Endpoint Has No Authentication or Authorization

### Issue

The `/users` route returns user data to anyone who can reach the service:

```js
app.get('/users', (req, res) => {
  res.json([
    { id: 1, name: 'Alice', email: 'alice@example.com' },
