# 6. No JSON Body Size Limit

## Issue

The app currently does not parse request bodies. That means body-based attacks are not immediately relevant.

However, most Express APIs eventually add:

```js
app.use(express.json());
```

If added without a size limit, large payloads can cause memory pressure.

## Recommendation

When adding JSON parsing, set an explicit limit:

```js
app.use(express.json({ limit: '100kb' }));
```

If forms are added:

```js
app.use(express.urlencoded({ extended: false, limit: '100kb' }));
```

